MediaPipe assets vendored for Arm's Length
==========================================

These files are served from this app instead of a CDN, so face landmarking works
without a third party being reachable. They are unmodified copies of Google's
release artifacts, licensed under the Apache License 2.0 (see LICENSE in this
folder).

